<newsitem itemid="467559" id="root" date="1997-03-25" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Meristem full-year profits rise.</title>
<headline>Meristem full-year profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.0		    vs 7.3</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 2.1		    vs 1.8</p>
<p> Pretax		     3.6		    vs 2.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   30.14		  vs 16.73</p>
<p>NOTE - The chemicals company said trading for 1997 &quot;had started slowly,&quot; but added it expected &quot;the major contribution for the full year to arise in the second half.&quot;</p>
<p>Full company name - Meristem Plc</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
